OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA breezy
OL,6,Fevening to come with some further
OL,7,Fshowers moving southwards across the
OL,8,Fregion. The breeze and showers will
OL,9,Fgradually ease overnight allowing some
OL,10,Fclearer spells to develop.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA few showers around first
OL,13,Fthing on Thursday, but these will
OL,14,Fquickly fade leaving a largely dry day
OL,15,Fwith sunny spells. Lighter winds than
OL,16,Ftoday with temperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
